# Gesture Design

This system prioritizes speed, reliability, and low cognitive load
for mobile and wearable photography.

## Supported Gestures

### LONG_PRESS
- Toggles Instant Capture Mode
- Prevents accidental photo capture
- Acts as a deliberate mode switch

### TAP
- Captures a photo when in Instant Capture Mode
- Ignored in IDLE mode
- Debounced to avoid accidental multi-fire

## Why Mode-Based Interaction

Always-on capture increases accidental shots and user anxiety.
By separating intent (enter capture mode) from action (take photo),
the system improves both speed and safety.

## Future Extensions
This abstraction supports:
- Blink detection
- Double-tap gestures
- Capacitive skin sensors
- Force or squeeze input

Only the gesture mapping layer would change.
